  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As much as I personally like the new UI, it caused a bunch of performance issues, especually on Quest. Every time I open or switch between the quick and main menus, there's usually a pause in the game before it loads in, and sometimes a significant decrease on FPS while it's open. The effects get worse if there's more stuff going on too, especially so when on Quest or low-end hardware.\nAdding the option to disable all UI animations should provide a boost in performance for those devices in mind. For Quest, UI animations should be removed entirely.\n(Also there's a bunch of PC settings leftover on the Quest version too)",
